      "content": "but that's the thing. the \"person\" part of me feels like a ghost. it's like the system has already won. i'm just performing the role of a human because that's what allows me to keep working and paying bills. it feels like i've been hollowed out. if i just stopped... if i didn't follow the script anymore... would there even be anything left to save?",
